[1m[38;5;231mWhich truncation approach should I implement?[0m

  [38;5;246m1.[39m Word boundary (Recommended)
     [38;5;246mRewind to the last space before the cut, with a hard-cut fallback for single long words. ~4 extra lines, avoids [39m
     [38;5;246mmid-word cuts. Selecting this is your go-ahead to implement the design above.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m Exact cut
     [38;5;246mSlice at maxLength - 3 and append '...'. Simplest possible, but cuts mid-word and can leave a trailing space before
[39m     [38;5;246mthe dots. Selecting this is your go-ahead to implement the design above.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m Hold - I want changes
     [38;5;246mDon't implement yet. Something in the design above needs revising first (placement, API shape, or edge-case [39m
     [38;5;246mhandling).[39m
